<title>PORTUGAL: Cape Verde seen opening bourse in 1998.</title>
<headline>Cape Verde seen opening bourse in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The West African state of Cape Verde is expected to open a stock exchange in 1998 after preparatory help from Lisbon bourse authorities, Lisbon bourse managing director Jose Carlos Pestana Teixeira said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are working with the government of Cape Verde in the organisation of its capital market and all the regulations have been prepared by us,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe that the Cape Verde bourse could start operating some time in 1998,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
